sequenceDiagram
    participant D as Debitor
    participant App as Demo App
    participant RPC as Soroban RPC
    participant Fac as Factory
    participant Iss as Issuer
    participant Tok as Token

    D->>App: Fill transfer form<br/>(account, amount, destination, uuid)
    App->>RPC: simulateTransaction
    RPC-->>App: simulation result
    App->>App: Sign tx + auth entries
    App->>RPC: sendTransaction
    RPC->>Fac: transfer_to_destination()
    Note over Fac: Pause check<br/>Debitor auth check<br/>Destination allowlist<br/>Velocity limits
    Fac->>Iss: transfer_to_destination()
    Iss->>Tok: transfer_from(issuer, account, dest, amount)
    Tok-->>Iss: success
    Iss-->>Fac: success
    Fac-->>RPC: event emission
    RPC-->>App: tx confirmed
    App-->>D: Transfer complete
